Like the river above which it was built,

18
00:01:27,160 --> 00:01:30,000
the students of this school have come from the world

19
00:01:30,001 --> 00:01:33,100
of the country and altered the world around them.

20
00:01:35,440 --> 00:01:38,740
West Point's purpose is to teach young cadets what it takes

21
