00:03:09,962 --> 00:03:11,600
Joseph M. Harrison.

48
00:03:12,500 --> 00:03:14,500
Jeffrey D. Hay.

49
00:03:17,660 --> 00:03:20,200
Occupying a relatively small parcel of land

