60
00:04:00,740 --> 00:04:03,280
liberal arts baccalaureate education.

61
00:04:03,380 --> 00:04:07,080
And so we're unique in that regard, in that the professional

62
00:04:07,180 --> 00:04:10,200
development and the undergraduate education sort

63
