70
00:04:36,320 --> 00:04:39,080
the young cadets for leadership through a program that has been

71
00:04:39,180 --> 00:04:43,900
defined and refined for over 200 years.

72
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:47,520
Cadets spend four years going through a very

73
00:04:47,521 --> 00:04:53,520
very systematic leadership and military professional development program.

